Subject: Legends from layer_boxplots() and layer_densities() do not respect factor levels as I expected
Message-ID: <quD4bplCqpA.j0ojpGvYbd8J@ggvis.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/ggvis/c/quD4bplCqpA/m/j0ojpGvYbd8J>
